WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.436
-Welcome back.
We are here with Gwen Stefani.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.304
Now, Gwen,
in honor of your new single,

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.540
"Let Me Reintroduce Myself,"
I want to help you

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:11.878
reintroduce yourself by asking
a few get-to-know-you questions.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.846
-And by a few, I mean 50.
-Perfect.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:17.150
This is "50 Yes or Nos."
-Oh, my God.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.618
-♪ "50 Yes or Nos" ♪

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:22.755
♪ "50 Yes or Nos" ♪

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:25.124
Alright, like I said, there are
50 of these,

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.226
so you need to answer
as quickly as possible,

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.728
but say whatever you like,
alright?

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.196
Ready?
-Okay, okay.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.330
-Here we go.
♪♪

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.766 line:0%
-Did you grow up in Anaheim?
-Yes.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.202 line:0%
-Ever been to Disneyland?
-Yes.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.870 line:0%
-Is Space Mountain
the best ride?

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.506 line:0%
-No.
-Have you ever seen a UFO?

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.708 line:0%
-No.
-What was your first job?

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.811 line:0%
Was it at Dairy Queen?
-Yes.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.412 line:0%
-Did you give your friends
free Blizzards?

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.983 line:0%
-I would make myself mistakes
and eat them in the back.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:53.153 line:0%
-Did you ever do vocals
for Sublime?

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:54.386 line:0%
-Yes.

00:00:54.386 --> 00:00:57.256 line:0%
-Were you the one who named your
ska band No Doubt?

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.390 line:0%
-No.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.493 line:0%
-Can you do the ska dance
known as skanking?

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:01.494 line:0%
-Yes, I can skank.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.562 line:0%
-Yeah, of course.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.130 line:0%
Will No Doubt
ever make more music?

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.398 line:0%
-I don't know.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.366 line:0%
-Can we karaoke together
sometime?

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.635 line:0%
-Yes.
-Are you afraid of the dark?

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:11.471 line:0%
-No.
-Are you afraid of spiders?

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:13.473 line:0%
-Kind of.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.875 line:0%
-Would you hold
a tarantula for $100?

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.943 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.078 line:0%
-Is 5'8" tall?

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.281 line:0%
-Yes.
-Do you believe in ghosts?

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:22.448 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:24.183 line:0%
-Do you believe in
love at first sight?

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.185 line:0%
-Yes.
-Do you believe in Bigfoot?

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:30.289 line:0%
-Blake? Yes.
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:31.857 line:0%
-Have you ever been skydiving?

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:33.259 line:0%
-No.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.327 line:0%
-Does grass smell good?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:35.495 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.163 line:0%
-Have you ever seen your
fiancé, Blake Shelton,

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:38.498 line:0%
dunk a basketball?

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.832 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:41.701 line:0%
-Do you always eat breakfast?

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:44.169 line:0%
-No.
-Are puppies cuter than kittens?

00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:45.838 line:0%
-I would go with yes.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:47.807 line:0%
-Is the Grand Canyon
really just a big ditch?

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.008 line:0%
-I don't know.

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.943 line:0%
-Yeah, if someone
has something in their teeth,

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:51.945 line:0%
would you tell them?

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.112 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:55.347 line:0%
-Are you a hollaback girl?
-No.

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:58.284 line:0%
-Is bananas spelled
B-A-N-A-N-A-S?

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.285 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.188 line:0%
-Is tomatoes spelled
T-O-M-A-T-T-O-S?

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:06.159 line:0%
-No.
-Are tomatoes a fruit?

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.159 line:0%
-Yes.

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.395 line:0%
-Are you a vegetarian?
-Yes.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.464 line:0%
-Is there oat milk
in your fridge right now?

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.866 line:0%
-No.
-Have you tried avocado milk?

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:15.134 line:0%
-No.

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:17.169 line:0%
-Did it feel amazing to get
the first win as a coach

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:18.238 line:0%
on "The Voice"?

00:02:18.238 --> 00:02:22.007 line:0%
-Yes!
It felt so good to beat Blake!

00:02:22.007 --> 00:02:23.977 line:0%
-Does Carter Rubin
have the voice of an angel?

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.444 line:0%
-Yes.

00:02:25.444 --> 00:02:27.513 line:0%
-Do you ever get dizzy when
"The Voice" chair spins around?

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:28.647 line:0%
-No.

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:30.850 line:0%
-Are cargo pants
making a comeback?

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.318 line:0%
-I have no idea.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.953 line:0%
-Are mullets making a comeback?

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.422 line:0%
-Yes.
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.091 line:0%
And then, is it rude
to hang up on telemarketers?

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:42.061 line:0%
-No.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.829 line:0%
-Are hot tubs gross?

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:45.531 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yeah, they are.

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:47.500 line:0%
Do you own a Ping-Pong table?

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.002 line:0%
-No.
-Is cinnamon a good gum flavor?

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:51.036 line:0%
-No.

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:53.239 line:0%
-Do you remember those
Budweiser frogs?

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.209 line:0%
-No. Oh, yes.
I think I do remember the frogs.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.344 line:0%
-During your
Las Vegas residency,

00:02:58.344 --> 00:02:59.512 line:0%
did you play any poker?

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.648 line:0%
-No.
-Did you see Cirque du Solei?

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.850 line:0%
-Yes.
-Do you like surprise parties?

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.952 line:0%
-No. Not really.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:07.720 line:0%
-Do you make
New Year's resolutions?

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.122 line:0%
-Not really.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.790 line:0%
-Do your remember when you
played Jean Harlow in

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:11.791 line:0%
"The Aviator"?

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:12.925 line:0%
-Yes. That was awesome.

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:14.693 line:0%
-Is it acceptable to reply
to a text message

00:03:14.693 --> 00:03:16.962 line:0%
with just the letter "K"?

00:03:16.962 --> 00:03:19.332 line:0%
-Yes.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:21.433 line:0%
Should guac cost extra?

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.669 line:0%
-No.
-Are you happy we're done?

00:03:23.669 --> 00:03:25.071 line:0%
-Yes.
[ Dinging ]

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:27.140 line:0%
-We did it! 50 questions!
-That was hard.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.408 line:0%
All 50.
-That was a lot.

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:31.711 line:0%
-My thanks to Gwen Stefani.
We love you, buddy.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.479 line:0%
Her new single,
"Let Me Reintroduce Myself,

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.581 line:0%
is out now.

